========================================================================================
Setup and compile the development version of direct simulation for 2023
========================================================================================

Currently (June 2026) this requires CMSSW_16_1_0_pre4
and the recipe from:
https://github.com/CTPPS/cmssw/tree/ab-dev-dirsim/Validation/CTPPS/test/simu#readme

========================================================================================
Setup a working area to run the systematics configs. 
========================================================================================
git clone git@github.com:jjhollar/TestProtonSystematics.git

cd TestProtonSystematics

mkdir proton_reco_misalignment

mkdir proton_reco_optics

mkdir proton_reco_resolution

========================================================================================
In systematics_2023_cfg.py, or systematics_2018_cfg.py:
========================================================================================

   Uncomment *one* value at a time for either ASYST (alignment systematics), or OSYST (optics systematics),
   or RSYST (resolution)

   Edit the path to the misalignment_*_*.xml files (these are the same files that were in the
   proton_simulation_validation/templates/proton_reco_misalignment directory in the old recipe)

cmsRun systematics_2023_cfg.py
(or cmsRun systematics_2018_cfg.py)